  "Each host needs D1 for relay state, R2 for attachments, and role-specific secrets. Enter your deployed HTTPS URL and phone key in the app under Muse Gadget SDK.": "每种部署方式都需要 D1 保存中继状态、R2 保存附件，并设置各角色的密钥。在应用中选择 Muse Gadget SDK，输入部署后的 HTTPS 网址和手机连接密钥。",
  "Head-up recording · Beta 0.3.13+": "抬头录音 · Beta 0.3.13+",
  "Settings → Head-up display → Raise head to wake → Record on wake. Tap the glasses to send or double-tap to cancel.": "设置 → 抬头显示 → 抬头唤醒显示 → 唤醒时开始录音。轻点眼镜发送，轻点两下取消。",
  "Live captions on compatible HTTPS relays": "兼容的 HTTPS 中继支持实时字幕",
  "A compatible HTTPS relay shows live captions while you speak and sends final text to Muse. Other relays receive a WAV on send.": "兼容的 HTTPS 中继会在你说话时显示实时字幕，并将最终文本发送给 Muse。其他中继会在发送时接收 WAV。",
  "Send voice through your relay": "通过你的中继发送语音",
  "Keep Transcribe via relay. If the configured HTTPS relay reports capabilities.live_transcription, use its Soniox captions during recording and send only final text to Muse. Keep the Soniox key on the relay. A WAV-only relay forwards one mono PCM WAV through the paired Gadget SDK on send. Use its matching message.user transcript when available. Link the Muse reply with reply_to equal to the original request ID and preserve the G2 speaker filter.": "保持选择通过中继转录。如果已配置的 HTTPS 中继报告 capabilities.live_transcription，录音时使用其 Soniox 字幕，并且只将最终文本发送给 Muse。将 Soniox 密钥保存在中继。仅支持 WAV 的中继会在发送时通过配对的 Gadget SDK 转发 单声道 WAV。若匹配的 message.user 带有转录，则使用该结果。将 Muse 回复的 reply_to 设置为原请求 ID，并保留 G2 说话人筛选。",
  "Verify the saved audio route with a short recording. For live captions, check that text arrives before release and that the final text matches the Muse reply's request ID.": "录一小段语音以验证已保存的音频路径。使用实时字幕时，确认松开前已收到文字，并且 Muse 回复对应最终文本的请求 ID。",
  "Live captions through your HTTPS relay": "通过 HTTPS 中继显示实时字幕",
