  "Images start off. Receiving Muse images and sending phone photos are separate features; send photos only when your connected relay supports them.": "图片初始关闭。接收 Muse 图片与发送手机照片是两项独立功能；仅在所连接的中转支持时发送照片。",
  "Copied. Paste into Muse and send.": "已复制。请粘贴到 Muse 并发送。",
  "G2Muse Gist · Keep existing settings": "G2Muse Gist · 保留现有设置",
  "extend my existing G2Muse setup": "扩展我现有的 G2Muse 设置",
  "I already use a G2Muse-compatible Gist. Reuse that same Gist for Muse Relay. Do not initialize or replace it. Inspect the existing watcher and ask it to handle Muse Relay's request files; do not launch a second writer. Preserve all old messages, files, voice settings, images, Spaces, and profile data. Use the connection contract below only to extend the existing setup.": "我已经在用兼容 G2Muse 的 Gist。请让 Muse Relay 复用同一个 Gist，不要初始化或替换它。检查现有监视程序，让它处理 Muse Relay 的请求文件；不要启动第二个写入程序。保留所有旧消息、文件、语音设置、图片、空间和个人资料。下面的连接协议仅用于扩展现有构成。",
  "Check a new short text request and its matching reply first. Then check the existing audio route: keep the transcript on the original You message and link Muse's reply with reply_to. Do not switch transcription services or require a new avatar. Ask only for the missing settings through secure setup. Cleanup must be limited to confirmed requests and their owned input attachments in one update; leave unknown or unmatched IDs for individual review.": "先检查一条新的短文字请求及其对应回复。再检查现有音频路径：把转写文本保留在原始 You 消息中，用 reply_to 关联 Muse 回复。不要更换转写服务，也不要要求新头像。只通过安全设置询问缺失的配置。清理范围限于已确认的请求和其自有输入附件，并在一次更新中完成；ID 未知或不匹配时，保留内容，逐项确认。",
  "Create voice instructions": "生成语音说明"
